  "narration": "The greatest theft in history won't happen at gunpoint. It will happen through a mechanism called Financial Repression. We believe markets set the price of money. We are wrong. The state has seized the levers of credit. Central banks are no longer in charge. Politicians are. The goal is simple: Inflate the debt away. By keeping interest rates low and inflation high, your savings vanish. It is a 4% annual tax on your purchasing power. The debt to GDP ratio demands it. There is no other exit. Capital will be forced into government bonds by law. The free market in money is dead. CAPEX is the new king. The ink is already dry. Your gold is now your shield.",

